8566","id":3002007115,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6y7v5L","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-24T22:00:05Z","updated_at":"2025-06-24T22:00:05Z","body":"We discussed this at the GDExtension meeting, and we think this is a case where it makes sense to add compatibility methods. Even if the original methods wouldn't have had any effect, if someone did call them, it would lead to a crash after updating Godot. Adding compatibility methods that do nothing or print an error/warning would be acceptable.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3002007115/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3003660180","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98566#issuecomment-3003660180","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98566","id":3003660180,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6zCDeU","user":{"login":